# HP50g ARMToolbox install through the original File Manager.
# Put real destination port 2. on the stack, select the actual SETUP.BIN
# on SD, execute the selected installer, warmstart, then verify library 275.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
6500 tap two
6800 tap period
7100 tap enter
7900 capture port-number
8500 chord lshift files
10700 capture files
11000 tap up
11300 tap f6
13000 capture sd
13300 tap enter
13600 tap down
14300 capture sd-setup
14700 tap f5
16500 capture setup-evaluated
17500 chord on f3
19500 capture warmstart
20000 chord rshift two
21200 capture lib
21600 tap f3
22900 capture port2
23300 tap f4
24600 capture armtoolbox
25000 finish-install
